# TableTurn prototype: prep list and supplier reorder from par levels
items = {"chicken thighs": (4, 10, "lb"), "rice": (10, 25, "lb"), "limes": (12, 30, "ct")}  # name: (on_hand, par, unit)

def reorder_list(inventory):
    out = []
    for name, (on_hand, par, unit) in inventory.items():
        if on_hand < par:
            out.append(f"{name}: order {par - on_hand} {unit}")
    return out

if __name__ == "__main__":
    for line in reorder_list(items):
        print(line)
EOF
